---
import Icon3D from './Icon3D.astro';
---
<section id="languages" class="site-section languages-section">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <header class="section-heading section-heading--split">
      <div><span class="section-eyebrow">Área académica</span><h2>Enseñanza de cinco idiomas</h2></div>
      <p>Una aproximación pedagógica que combina comunicación, lectura, expresión escrita y análisis cultural.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="language-grid">
      <article class="language-card">
        <div class="editorial-card-top"><span class="language-flag" aria-hidden="true">🇪🇸</span><span class="editorial-card-index">01 / IDIOMA</span></div>
        <div class="editorial-card-copy"><span class="language-level">Avanzado · Literario</span><h3>Español</h3><p>Hispanismo, redacción académica y análisis del texto literario.</p></div>
        <span class="language-card-mark"><Icon3D name="book" /></span>
      </article>
      <article class="language-card">
        <div class="editorial-card-top"><span class="language-flag" aria-hidden="true">🇫🇷</span><span class="editorial-card-index">02 / IDIOMA</span></div>
        <div class="editorial-card-copy"><span class="language-level">Universitario</span><h3>Francés</h3><p>Expresión escrita, literatura francófona y traducción.</p></div>
        <span class="language-card-mark"><Icon3D name="file" /></span>
      </article>
      <article class="language-card">
        <div class="editorial-card-top"><span class="language-flag" aria-hidden="true">🇬🇧</span><span class="editorial-card-index">03 / IDIOMA</span></div>
        <div class="editorial-card-copy"><span class="language-level">Académico</span><h3>Inglés</h3><p>Comprensión de textos, comunicación y análisis textual.</p></div>
        <span class="language-card-mark"><Icon3D name="globe" /></span>
      </article>
      <article class="language-card">
        <div class="editorial-card-top"><span class="language-flag" aria-hidden="true">🇩🇪</span><span class="editorial-card-index">04 / IDIOMA</span></div>
        <div class="editorial-card-copy"><span class="language-level">Formativo</span><h3>Alemán</h3><p>Gramática, lectura técnica y diálogo expresivo.</p></div>
        <span class="language-card-mark"><Icon3D name="sparkle" /></span>
      </article>
      <article class="language-card">
        <div class="editorial-card-top"><span class="language-flag" aria-hidden="true">🇲🇦</span><span class="editorial-card-index">05 / IDIOMA</span></div>
        <div class="editorial-card-copy"><span class="language-level">Clásico · Dialectal</span><h3>Árabe</h3><p>Árabe estándar, retórica y patrimonio literario magrebí.</p></div>
        <span class="language-card-mark"><Icon3D name="book" /></span>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>